Package: scfa
Title: Sequential Confirmatory Factor Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Zach", "Essesjohnson", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zachessesjohnson@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Implements Sequential Confirmatory Factor Analysis (Sequential CFA),
    a hierarchical factor analysis approach that estimates each level of the
    hierarchy independently rather than simultaneously. This preserves the full
    sample size at each stage, removes cross-level covariance estimation, and
    provides valid estimates in cases where traditional or Bayesian CFA fail to
    converge. The package provides error-propagation diagnostics, loading
    corrections for regression-score attenuation, residual variance corrections
    for Bartlett scores, a multi-stage propagation chain helper, and a
    high-level orchestration function for running the full sequential workflow.
